":"x_115648e47de1eef35a6d","language":"ja","text":"【名/U/C】 《...の》解消, 絶縁, 崩壊, 分裂, 解体 《of ...》/ 破綻する,別れる；（結婚・関係など）を終わらせる / ばらばらになる,分解される； をばらばらに分解する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_972269ab8f6bf1749f37","expressionId":"x_373e55a6b67d1bb76001","language":"ja","text":"【句動】を書き留める,を記録する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_f5529a6cf0adb29084f6","expressionId":"x_ebf811f2fee9a8cc7614","language":"ja","text":"【句動】《...に》本腰を入れて取り組む《to ...》/ 身体を低くする,伏せる；ひざまずく《on one's knee》/  《...へ / ...から》降りる,を降ろす《to ... / from ...》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_bc0bec5a34033a5d8189","expressionId":"x_2d9eb78780d8ec543422","language":"ja","text":"【句動】飛び越す,行く / を越える / を詳しく調べる,をよく見る","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_450fc1a8566ef8b76420","expressionId":"x_d44fcf731c17b28d746d","language":"ja","text":"遠慮なく進める","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_12a9443b3c5dd7744c65","expressionId":"x_7531f8f7e8d3c18cb043","language":"ja","text":"【動/自】続く, 《...を》続ける《with ...》,そのまま進む, 《...ついて》勝手に喋り続ける《about ...》 【動/他】...を着たままでいる,...を取らないでいる / ...を続ける","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_c42fa9439ef30b8e6143","expressionId":"x_646a367a8494d66e7330","language":"ja","text":"（物･人が）...まで達する, ...に届く/ …のすぐそばまでやってくる / ...に匹敵する / （期待など）に沿う","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_e8285015faab2c1b05d2","expressionId":"x_1c009af3ff5717030f25","language":"ja","text":"（今とちがって）以前はよく...した, かつては…するのが常であった《~ do》 / （今とちがって）以前は...だった《~ be ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_818eaabeffe779dba709","expressionId":"x_e8ea285a10be087a7c03","language":"ja","text":"《be ~》...なはずである /  《be ~ do》（取り決めにより）...することになっている / （期待に沿うために）...しなければならない / （法則などにより）...するものである / 《過去形で》...するはずだった","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_4c8a28e1ffa5aef52564","expressionId":"x_5ab7dcbeb751e47bf7f7","language":"ja","text":"《~ do》（積極的に望みはしないが）...してもいい, ...してもかまわない / (状況から考えて) ...した方がいい / 《控えめな提案》よければ…したらどう / 《~ A as B》Bするくらいなら、Aしたほうがマシだ","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_395b9417dd8c08bd718a","expressionId":"x_7120b70f24ce76711ece","language":"ja","text":"《かたく》現在, 目下, 今のところは","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_94bfeb03e407e0f17120","expressionId":"x_d44fcf731c17b28d746d","language":"ja","text":"遠慮なく進める","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_9b67bedab306b7b7c4d6","expressionId":"x_c65f5cf7d423f6f53415","language":"ja","text":"死に至るまで / （行為の結果）死に至って / 《くだけて》死ぬほど, 非常に","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_447ba9be1dd95cb1bf67","expressionId":"x_c1928bf486e8a0e77496","language":"ja","text":"2, 3の, 少数の, いくつかの / 一対の,２つの","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c56a96c377b3c1185fa6","expressionId":"x_1589e7b7b0270eaaeec0","language":"ja","text":"（後の状況と対比させて）初めのうちは, 最初は","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_eba3f4acd744fd2cbd91","expressionId":"x_c0306e980be7ca68d8ec","language":"ja","text":"（ある情報）に照らして, ...を考慮して.","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_d375b5945102f9f54073","expressionId":"x_637109e3b85451bb11c9","language":"ja","text":"...と考える, ...と判断する /《be ~》...と考えられている /《It is widely [generally, commonly] ~ 》...と一般的に考えられている","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c083e35aced9fd89c878","expressionId":"x_8ae54a38605d542948cd","language":"ja","text":"...と一致して, ...と合致して / （規則・慣習など）に従って, ...に沿って","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_df547f729968f69d2625","expressionId":"x_bcd42fa25f4d742a92f9","language":"ja","text":"《くだけた話》しゃべるな,黙れ / 話をやめる / ...を黙らせる / 店を閉める,廃業する.","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_e8b526c2116c64876d55","expressionId":"x_5bd39b5307bcd73985e7","language":"ja","text":"逃げ道, 回避法, 逃げ方","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_acf9dc28f1a7448e8508","expressionId":"x_1f9d5e9d3cbb9313f90b","language":"ja","text":"【句】ある程度の","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_53d111a5b9c4566be6d0","expressionId":"x_6143df5903b69b9547c5","language":"ja","text":"《a ~》《かたく・大げさに》豊富な..., 多量の..., 多数の...","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_1096758d4352cdd917ff","expressionId":"x_a5b19641722999026cf2","language":"ja","text":"いくつかの... / たくさんの...","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_2fcd9c2f6f64b24b9a91","expressionId":"x_6af4a5f94f2048402772","language":"ja","text":"（人や組織など）と妥協する, ...と折り合いをつける / （不快なことなど）を受け入れる, ...を甘受する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_163c4915df1ac2cfb364","expressionId":"x_8283d66f3fd2610a4650","language":"ja","text":"【副】全体にわたって,一面に / すっかり,全部終わって / どこからどこまでも, いかにも（人･物）らしい / 【前】《be 〜 ...》...を支配して","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_79821e2d504c925f410d","expressionId":"x_2cee4503f377e2c535cf","language":"ja","text":"（中断していたこと）を続ける《with》；すぐに行動を開始する,ぐずぐずせずにやる 《with it》 / （乗り物）に乗る / うまくやっていく, 仲良くやっていく, 気が合う / 《~ better terms with ...》...とより良い関係になる","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_4c4328f2e3b4f8d02afd","expressionId":"x_9a80576249dd67b92872","language":"ja","text":"そうする","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_11777fbd284bca9a62d9","expressionId":"x_a6bd3fb9c38e26105fb8","language":"ja","text":"...するのも分かる, ...するのももっともだ / おそらく…だろう, 十分に…する可能性がある","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_368edbd9f3f0481d844d","expressionId":"x_be7b16f555550dc3edcd","language":"ja","text":"（しばしば好ましくないことに対して）非常に,あまりにも","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_9767cd8808abc30eb55c","expressionId":"x_ab6b7abe5e492f9b6d75","language":"ja","text":"…するために, …となるように / それで, そのため","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_0c58a58bf6155246255f","expressionId":"x_cdc874b9a974f4707bb0","language":"ja","text":"同時に,それと同時に / 併せて, いっぺんに / その一方で","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_35c9e320037400d92d8c","expressionId":"x_7b27d4bc2ad1d02ed214","language":"ja","text":"《be ~ 》...に導かれる, ...を長としている","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_2b79a237f4431e0e0202","expressionId":"x_b252eba3702a6b3f42ab","language":"ja","text":"もしそうなら, そうだとしたら","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_8adbafc9c33388e2e1d2","expressionId":"x_c3c64750a3ff307ceecd","language":"ja","text":"それに比べて,対照的に","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_374044e5a27e7cf5d786","expressionId":"x_48bb3633616fc5c0b234","language":"ja","text":"適切な, 的を射た / 《get ~》要点を言う, 核心をつく","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_9cd58f30d23558c8d695","expressionId":"x_ff950b5d1efb92c1af2e","language":"ja","text":"《かたく》 （物・事）に関しては, ...については","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_4cd19952733d2715b69c","expressionId":"x_63c82853836600591366","language":"ja","text":"...と全く同じように, ...のとおりに / ...と同じ程度に / ちょうど...のときに","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_53b91158d1ce565d3d7b","expressionId":"x_c59faf336a20d9bb4930","language":"ja","text":"クレジットカード","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_47a0bc0207b1f379d005","expressionId":"x_0fea5d62e782aaefb76b","language":"ja","text":"うんざりして,がっかりして,不愉快な","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_b3063dd19841f912593f","expressionId":"x_4d12e35e54ff5380744d","language":"ja","text":"《未来形で》喜んで(進んで)…する(willing)","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_a1866221dc1016383411","expressionId":"x_2c200509feda6d82f5ac","language":"ja","text":"心臓発作,心臓まひ","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_81f2bd4303af995d453b","expressionId":"x_cdd3dbac09b7816ee143","language":"ja","text":"見地,観点(viewpoint) / 考え方,態度","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_de1517e4dead49d74782","expressionId":"x_26ac98196b0bf766255e","language":"ja","text":"『首相』,『総理大臣』(《略》P.M.)","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_bc78f95a9555901add08","expressionId":"x_968a58eccfc8fa4b37fc","language":"ja","text":"洗濯機","source":"EJDict"}]